### ============================================
### 谁是卧底游戏 API 测试
### ============================================

### 1. 创建游戏房间
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/undercover/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "players": ["张三", "李四", "王五", "赵六", "小明", "小红"],
  "category": "水果"
}

### 2. 获取房间信息（把上面的roomId复制过来）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/undercover/room/abc123

### 3. 玩家1生成描述
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/undercover/describe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "房间ID",
  "playerId": "张三"
}

### 4. 玩家2生成描述
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/undercover/describe
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "房间ID",
  "playerId": "李四"
}

### 5. 玩家1投票
POST http://localhost:8080/api/game/undercover/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": "房间ID",
  "playerId": "张三",
  "discussion": "张三说这是红色的水果，李四说这是甜甜的..."
}

### 6. 获取所有描述
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/undercover/descriptions/房间ID

### 7. 获取投票结果
GET http://localhost:8080/api/game/undercover/votes/房间ID